<title>RUSSIA: GUM, Krasnoyarskenergo, Lenenergo join RTS Index.</title>
<headline>GUM, Krasnoyarskenergo, Lenenergo join RTS Index.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System index of 21 leading shares will be expanded to 24 shares from September 16, the Russian national brokers association NAUFOR said.</p>
<p>Ordinary shares of retailer Torogovy Dom GUM, Siberian power utility AO Krasnoyarskenergo and St Petersburg utility AO Lenenergo will be included in the index, it said in a press release.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
